 "result": "{\"answer\": \"Jeff Bezos. As of 1 June 2021, Jeffrey P. Bezos \u2014 Amazon's founder \u2014 was still President and Chief Executive Officer of Amazon.com, Inc. Amazon had announced in February 2021 that Bezos would transition to Executive Chairman and that Andy Jassy (then head of Amazon Web Services) would succeed him, but that handover did not take effect until 5 July 2021. So on 1 June 2021, Bezos remained CEO and Jassy was still CEO of AWS.\", \"confidence\": \"high\", \"abstained\": false}",
